Landav invokes the following external solvers. They are NOT distributed with
this software; they are discovered on PATH or installed separately by the user.

  KoAT  -- upper bound analysis for integer transition systems
  LoAT  -- lower bound analysis for integer transition systems

Their licences are their own. Before changing the distribution model from
"discovered on PATH" to vendoring or bundling, their licence terms must be
reviewed for compatibility with this project's Apache-2.0 licence. See
